{title: Lord Send Revival}
{artist: Hillsong Young & Free}
{key: Bb}
{time: 6/8}

{comment: Strophe 1}
[Eb] [Bb] [Fsus] [F]
Peace like a river wash over me
Immerse me in water as deep as the sea
Hide me in love Your healing embrace
Peace like a river wash over me

{comment: Chorus}
[Eb] [Bb] [F] [Fsus] [F]
As I worship Your majesty
I worship Your holy Name
Jesus my everything
All that I am is Yours

{comment: Strophe 2}
[Eb] [Bb] [Fsus] [F]
Come Holy Spirit rain down on me
Break open the heavens and drench the unseen
Pour out Your presence as I pour out Your praise
Come Holy Spirit Lord have Your way

{comment: Chorus}
[Eb] [Bb] [F] [Fsus] [F]
As I worship Your majesty
I worship Your holy Name
Jesus my everything
All that I am is Yours

{comment: Bridge 1}
[Eb] [Bb] [Fsus] [F]
Open the heavens
Fling wide the gates
Flood every heart with mercy
Pour out Your presence Inhabit our praise
As we cry holy holy

{comment: Tag 1}
[Eb] [Bb] [F]
Whoa whoa
As we cry holy holy
Whoa whoa

{comment: Bridge 2}
[Eb] [Bb] [F] [Gm]
Lord send revival
Lord send it now
A move of Your Spirit
Heaven break out
Come now in power
Cover this land
Like You’ve done it before
Would You do it again

{comment: Tag 2}
[Eb] [Bb] [F]
Heaven break out
